duct and a very quiet pipeline, which is a frustrating combination.\" },\n  { n:'Nikolai Petrenko', c:'Argus Safety Group', r:'Sales Director', s:\"Re: Let's connect\", g:'Hi Katie,', k:'Best,',\n    p:\"Let's set something up. I'd want to understand how you keep the outreach from sounding automated.\",\n    x:\"Our buyers are technical and they can smell a template from a mile away.\" },\n  { n:'Delphine Aubert', c:'Coastline Media Group', r:'VP Client Development', s:'Re: Quick question', g:'Hi,', k:'Thanks so much,',\n    p:\"Quick one before we book anything: do you handle the replies as well, or does that come back to us?\" },\n  { n:'Malik Rahimi', c:'Ironwood Construction', r:'Director of Preconstruction', s:'Re: Your Company + Ironwood Construction', g:'Good morning Katie,', k:'Appreciate it,',\n    p:\"This is worth a look. We win work through relationships and we're running out of new ones.\" },\n  { n:'Sunniva Berglund', c:'Northgate Dental Partners', r:'Chief Growth Officer', s:'Re: Worth a conversation', g:'Hello,', k:'Best,',\n    p:\"I'd like to learn more. We're acquiring practices faster than we can generate demand for them.\" },\n  { n:'Theo Vandermeer', c:'Alder Ridge Advisors', r:'Partner', s:'Re: Interested in learning more', k:'Talk soon,',\n    p:\"You have my attention. Walk me through what the first ninety days would actually look like.\" },\n  { n:'Camille Boudreaux', c:'Verity Payments', r:'Head of Enterprise Sales', s:'Re: Connecting', g:'Hi Katie,', k:'Thanks,',\n    p:\"Glad you reached out. We're rebuilding our outbound motion from scratch and would rather not do it alone.\" },\n  { n:'Hassan El-Amin', c:'Foxglove Retail Group', r:'VP of Partnerships', s:'Re: Following up', g:'Katie,', k:'Regards,', nc:true,\n    p:\"Apologies for the slow reply. This is still very much on our list for the year.\" },\n  { n:'Beatrix Nowak', c:'Silverbirch Interiors', r:'Commercial Director', s:'Re: Exploring this', g:'Hi there,', k:'Kind regards,',\n    p:\"Interested in exploring this. Our sales cycle is long, so the top of the funnel matters more than anything.\" },\n  { n:'Owen Castellanos', c:'Tidewater Marine Supply', r:'Director of Sales', s:'Re: Your message', g:'Hi Katie,', k:'Cheers,',\n    p:\"Count me in for a call. We've grown through one channel for eight years and it's finally slowing down.\" },\n  { n:'Elodie Marchand', c:'Greyrock Energy Partners', r:'Director of Business Development', s:'Re: Your Company + Greyrock Energy Partners', k:'Best,',\n    p:\"Thanks for reaching out, and for keeping it short, which I appreciate more than you'd think.\",\n    b:[\n      'Hi Katie,',\n      \"Thanks for reaching out, and for keeping it short, which I appreciate more than you'd think.\",\n      \"Your note arrived at a reasonable moment. We've spent most of this year trying to build a repeatable way to reach new operators and it hasn't gone anywhere. Almost everything we win still comes from referrals and relationships that are a decade old, which is fine right up until it isn't.\",\n      \"Before I take this to our COO there are two things I'd want to understand: how you'd define the right audience for a company like ours, and what the first ninety days actually look like in practice.\",\n      \"I have time Thursday afternoon or Friday morning. Send over whatever you need from me beforehand and I'll have it ready.\"\n    ] }\n];\n\nconst TIMES = makeTimes(DATA.length);\n\nconst DAYS = [\n  { label: 'Mon', long: 'Monday 13', num: '13' },\n  { label: 'Tue', long: 'Tuesday 14', num: '14' },\n  { label: 'Wed', long: 'Wednesday 15', num: '15', today: true },\n  { label: 'Thu', long: 'Thursday 16', num: '16' },\n  { label: 'Fri', long: 'Friday 17', num: '17' }\n];\n\nconst MEETINGS = [\n  { d:0, s:60,  dur:45, t:'Discovery call', i:0 },\n  { d:0, s:180, dur:30, t:'Intro call', i:1 },\n  { d:0, s:330, dur:60, t:'Proposal review', i:2 },\n  { d:0, s:450, dur:30, t:'Follow-up', i:5 },\n  { d:1, s:30,  dur:45, t:'Scoping session', i:3 },\n  { d:1, s:120, dur:45, t:'Discovery call', i:4 },\n  { d:1, s:240, dur:30, t:'Pricing walkthrough', i:6 },\n  { d:1, s:360, dur:60, t:'Second call, ops team', i:7 },\n  { d:2, s:90,  dur:45, t:'Discovery call', i:8 },\n  { d:2, s:210, dur:30, t:'Intro call', i:9 },\n  { d:2, s:300, dur:45, t:'Proposal review', i:10 },\n  { d:2, s:480, dur:45, t:'Technical deep dive', i:15 },\n  { d:3, s:30,  dur:30, t:'Intro call', i:11 },\n  { d:3, s:150, dur:45, t:'Discovery call', i:12 },\n  { d:3, s:300, dur:60, t:'Contract review', i:13 },\n  { d:3, s:420, dur:45, t:'Kickoff', i:14 },\n  { d:4, s:60,  dur:45, t:'Discovery call', i:16 },\n  { d:4, s:180, dur:45, t:'Proposal review', i:17 },\n  { d:4, s:360, dur:30, t:'Intro call', i:18 },\n  { d:4, s:450, dur:45, t:'Strategy session', i:19 }\n];\n\nconst HOUR_H = 84;\n\nfunction clockFrom8(mins, ampm) {\n  const total = 8 * 60 + mins;\n  const h = Math.floor(total / 60), m = total % 60;\n  const h12 = h > 12 ? h - 12 : h;\n  return h12 + ':' + (m < 10 ? '0' + m : m) + (ampm ? (h < 12 ? ' AM' : ' PM') : '');\n}\n\nfunction emailFor(e, i) {\n  const parts = e.n.toLowerCase().split(' ');\n  const first = slug(parts[0]);\n  const last = slug(parts[parts.length - 1]);\n  const local = [\n    first + '.' + last,\n    first[0] + '.' + last,\n    first,\n    first + last,\n    first + '_' + last,\n    last + '.' + first,\n    first + '.' + last[0]\n  ][i % 7];\n  const tld = ['.com', '.com', '.co', '.com', '.io', '.net', '.com'][i % 7];\n  return local + '@' + slug(e.c) + tld;\n}\n\nconst CAMPAIGNS = ['Campaign 04', 'Campaign 04', 'Campaign 07', 'Campaign 04', 'Campaign 07'];\n\nfunction slug(s) { return s.toLowerCase().replace(/[^a-z0-9]/g, ''); }\nfunction initials(n) {\n  const parts = n.split(' ');\n  return (parts[0][0] + parts[parts.length - 1][0]).toUpperCase();\n}\n\nclass Component extends DCLogic {\n  constructor(props) {\n    super(props);\n    this.state = { arrived: 0, started: false, playing: false, selected: null, read: {}, view: 'inbox' };\n    this.timers = [];\n  }\n\n  isNarrow() {\n    const el = document.querySelector('[data-screen-label=\"Inbox\"]');\n    const w = el ? el.getBoundingClientRect().width : 0;\n    return w > 0 ? w < 620 : (typeof window !== 'undefined' && window.innerWidth < 700);\n  }\n\n  componentDidMount() {\n    if (this.props.autoPlay) this.timers.push(setTimeout(() => this.play(), 700));\n  }\n\n  componentWillUnmount() { this.clear(); }\n\n  clear() { this.timers.forEach(clearTimeout); this.timers = []; }\n\n  play = () => {\n    this.clear();\n    const restart = this.state.started;\n    const sc = document.querySelector('[data-inbox-scroll=\"1\"]');\n    if (sc) sc.scrollTop = 0;\n    this.setState({ arrived: 0, playing: false, selected: null, read: {}, started: true, view: 'inbox' });\n    this.timers.push(setTimeout(() => this.run(), restart ? 320 : 260));\n  };\n\n  run() {\n    const total = Math.max(4, Math.min(DATA.length, this.props.waveSize ?? 25));\n    const speed = this.props.speed ?? 1;\n    const reduced = typeof window !== 'undefined' && window.matchMedia\n      && window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;\n\n    if (reduced) {\n      this.setState({ arrived: total, playing: false, selected: total - 1, read: { [total - 1]: true } });\n      return;\n    }\n\n    this.setState({ playing: true });\n    let t = 0;\n    for (let i = 0; i < total; i++) {\n      const p = total > 1 ? i / (total - 1) : 0;\n      const gap = (370 - 285 * Math.sin(Math.PI * p)) / speed;\n      t += i === 0 ? 120 : gap;\n      this.timers.push(setTimeout(() => this.setState({ arrived: i + 1 }), t));\n    }\n    this.timers.push(setTimeout(() => this.setState({ playing: false }), t + 420));\n    this.timers.push(setTimeout(() => {\n      this.setState({ selected: total - 1, read: { [total - 1]: true } });\n    }, t + (this.isNarrow() ? 1600 : 620)));\n  }\n\n  select = (i) => () => {\n    this.setState((s) => ({ selected: i, read: Object.assign({}, s.read, { [i]: true }) }));\n  };\n\n  back = () => this.setState({ selected: null });\n\n  showCal = () => this.setState({ view: 'calendar' });\n\n  showInbox = () => this.setState({ view: 'inbox' });\n\n  renderVals() {\n    const s = this.state;\n    const layout = this.props.forceLayout ?? 'auto';\n    const cal = s.view === 'calendar';\n    const n = s.arrived;\n\n    const rows = DATA.slice(0, n).map((e, i) => {\n      const [tint, color] = TINTS[i % TINTS.length];\n      const isRead = !!s.read[i];\n      const sel = s.selected === i;\n      return {\n        slot: n - 1 - i,\n        name: e.n,\n        time: TIMES[i],\n        subject: e.s,\n        preview: e.p,\n        initials: initials(e.n),\n        tint, color,\n        bg: sel ? '#E6F3F9' : '#ffffff',\n        accent: sel ? '#0089C6' : 'transparent',\n        dot: isRead ? 0 : 1,\n        nameW: isRead ? 500 : 700,\n        subjW: isRead ? 500 : 700,\n        subjColor: isRead ? '#4a6070' : '#0d3038',\n        timeColor: isRead ? '#8a9daa' : '#0089C6',\n        onSelect: this.select(i)\n      };\n    });\n\n    const unread = n - Object.keys(s.read).length;\n    const openIdx = s.selected;\n    let open = false;\n    if (openIdx != null && DATA[openIdx]) {\n      const e = DATA[openIdx];\n      const [tint, color] = TINTS[openIdx % TINTS.length];\n      const first = e.n.split(' ')[0];\n      let body = e.b;\n      if (!body) {\n        body = [];\n        if (e.g) body.push(e.g);\n        body.push(e.p);\n        if (e.x) body.push(e.x);\n        if (!e.nc) body.push(CLOSERS[openIdx % CLOSERS.length]);\n      }\n      open = {\n        name: e.n, role: e.r, company: e.c, time: TIMES[openIdx], subject: e.s,\n        initials: initials(e.n), tint, color,\n        email: emailFor(e, openIdx),\n        campaign: CAMPAIGNS[openIdx % CAMPAIGNS.length],\n        body: body,\n        signoff: (e.k || 'Best,') + '\\n' + first\n      };\n    }\n\n    const vars = [\n      '--open:' + (open && s.started ? 1 : 0),\n      '--shown:' + (s.started ? 1 : 0),\n      '--idle-op:' + (s.started ? 0 : 1),\n      '--idle-pe:' + (s.started ? 'none' : 'auto'),\n      '--idle-scale:' + (s.started ? 0.8 : 1),\n      '--live-op:' + (s.playing ? 1 : 0),\n      '--chip-op:' + (n > 0 || cal ? 1 : 0),\n      'flex:1 1 520px',\n      'min-width:280px',\n      'max-width:700px',\n      'margin:0 auto'\n    ].join(';');\n\n    return {\n      rows, open, layout, count: n, unread: unread > 0 ? unread : 0, vars,\n      calendar: cal,\n      title: cal ? 'Calendar' : 'Inbox',\n      chip: cal ? MEETINGS.length + ' meetings' : (unread > 0 ? unread : 0) + ' new',\n      mailBtn: cal ? this.showInbox : this.play,\n      mailTitle: cal ? 'Back to inbox' : 'Replay',\n      showCal: this.showCal,\n      weekLabel: 'July 2026',\n      weekRange: 'Mon 13 to Fri 17',\n      gridH: HOUR_H * 9,\n      hours: [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8].map(function (k) {\n        return { top: k * HOUR_H, label: clockFrom8(k * 60, true).replace(':00', '') };\n      }),\n      days: DAYS.map(function (d, di) {\n        const evs = MEETINGS.filter(function (m) { return m.d === di; }).map(function (m, mi) {\n          const src = DATA[m.i];\n          const pair = TINTS[(m.i + mi) % TINTS.length];\n          return {\n            top: Math.round(m.s / 60 * HOUR_H),\n            h: Math.round(m.dur / 60 * HOUR_H) - 3,\n            title: m.t,\n            who: src.n + ', ' + src.c,\n            time: clockFrom8(m.s, false) + ' to ' + clockFrom8(m.s + m.dur, false),\n            tip: m.t + ' with ' + src.n + ', ' + src.c,\n            start: clockFrom8(m.s, true),\n            whoDisp: m.dur < 45 ? 'none' : 'block',\n            tint: pair[0], color: pair[1]\n          };\n        });\n        return {\n          label: d.label, long: d.long, num: d.num, events: evs,\n          countLabel: evs.length + (evs.length === 1 ? ' meeting' : ' meetings'),\n          dim: d.today ? '#0089C6' : '#8a9daa',\n          strong: d.today ? '#0089C6' : '#0d3038'\n        };\n      }),\n      play: this.play, back: this.back,\n      emptyTitle: s.playing ? 'Sorting the replies' : 'Nothing selected',\n      emptySub: s.playing ? 'Katie is reading and scoring every response as it lands' : 'Pick a reply from the list to read it'\n    };\n  }\n}\n\n<\u002Fscript>\n\n\n<\u002Fbody><\u002Fhtml>"
  </script>
